stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Preview
    state "预览已生成切线" as Preview
    state "移动切线（仅改坐标）" as Dragging
    state "边界未变" as Noop
    state "重新生成 JPEG" as Encoding
    state "新切片列表" as Updated
    state "重切片失败" as Retry
    Preview --> Dragging: 手柄拖动
    Dragging --> Noop: 松手 [像素边界不变]
    Dragging --> Encoding: 松手 [像素边界变化]
    Noop --> Preview: 无需重编码
    Encoding --> Updated: 解码、切片、输出成功
    Encoding --> Retry: I/O 或解码失败
    Retry --> Encoding: 重试提交
    Updated --> Dragging: 再次编辑
    Updated --> [*]: 返回结果列表
